BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stray Kids World Tour <RUN IT> LIVE VIEWING
DTSTART:20261107T040000Z
DTEND:20261107T040000Z
UID:stray-kids-world-tour-run-it-live-viewing-56278@pathe.ch
DESCRIPTION:For the first time\, Stray Kids presents a special live broadc
 ast of ‘Stray Kids World Tour <RUN IT>’ from Tokyo Dome in movie theat
 ers around the globe.<br/><br/>True to the tour's title\, <RUN IT> capture
 s the group's drive to push into bigger worlds and bolder stages. The eigh
 t members (Bang Chan\, Lee Know\, Changbin\, Hyunjin\, HAN\, Felix\, Seung
 min\, and I.N) pour out unrelenting energy through explosive choreography 
 and powerhouse vocals\, elevating the live experience to its peak. Their s
 tage begins with “Hall of Fame\,” a track that expresses Stray Kids’
  ambition to write their own history\, tracing their musical growth from t
 he very beginning to where they are now. The production is enriched furthe
 r by dynamic stage setups\, traditional Korean performance touches\, and s
 pectacular laser lighting\, designed to bring the crowd — in the dome an
 d at the cinema — to their feet\, singing\, dancing and celebrating toge
 ther.<br/><br/>Captured live from Tokyo and broadcast into cinemas worldwi
 de\, this live viewing event lets STAY everywhere share in the scale\, spe
 ctacle\, and raw energy of Stray Kids' live performance — together\, on 
 the big screen.<br/>
URL:https://www.pathe.ch/en/movies-events/stray-kids-world-tour-run-it-liv
 e-viewing-56278
